{"id":"wb-5-237","name":"明惠大师塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"明惠大师塔","text":"明惠大师塔位于中国山西省平顺县虹梯关乡虹霓村（原属不兰岩乡），2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n明惠大师塔是海惠院住持明惠大师的舍利塔，明惠大师于唐乾符四年（877年）遇害，塔身上的石碣为后唐长兴三年（932年）所记，则塔当建于这段时间内。海惠院早毁，独塔尚存。塔为石质，高6米，平面方形由塔基、塔身和塔刹三部分组成。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E6%83%A0%E5%A4%A7%E5%B8%88%E5%A1%94","revisionId":92192606,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92192606","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5742265e0a255d91473a7537.jpg","title":"20260404_Minghui_Master_Pagoda_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260404_Minghui_Master_Pagoda_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/20260404_Minghui_Master_Pagoda_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​平顺 明惠大师塔","width":320,"height":480}}